              <msb>3</msb>
            </field>
            <field>
              <name>SIZE</name>
              <description>This is a 4-bit value that indicates the total contiguous size of the memory window used by this component in powers of 2 from the standard 4KB. If a component only requires the standard 4KB, this must read as 0x0, 4KB only. For 8KB set to 0x1, for 16KB set to 0x2, for 32KB set to 0x3, and so on.</description>
